  "description": "A mountain of coins suddenly appears before Pirarucu, who loves shopping more than anything!\nWith this much money, she might be able to shop to her heart’s content!\nGrace and elegance? Out the window.\nPirarucu dashes forward—leaping over cliffs, stomping enemies, and dodging fireballs… for all in the name of shopping!\n\nThis spin-off mini-game from Goonya Monster stars series favorite Pirarucu.\nSpend your coins or save them—it’s all part of your strategy!\nCharge through a wild and unpredictable shopping run!\n\n◇ Simple controls!\nUse jumps and double jumps to navigate the stage.\nTiming is everything!\nEasy to learn, fun for players of all ages.\n\n◆ Become the ultimate shopaholic runner!\nAt checkpoints, you can spend your coins on skills and items to boost your run.\nGo on a spending spree too fast, and you’ll run out of coins in no time—so spend wisely. (That goes for everything.)\n\n◆ Danger lurks along the way…!\nEnemies and fireballs will try to stop your run.\nCrash into them, and it’s game over!\nStomp enemies to clear your path, and dodge fireballs with well-timed jumps.\n\n◆ Shopping is a race against time!\nPirarucu keeps accelerating as she runs.\nPush forward through the chaos and make it to the next checkpoint!\n\n◇ Battle mode (Local 2-player mode)\nIn battle mode, Pirarucu’s stepbrother Clione joins the action from Goonya Monster!\nUse items and outplay your opponent to collect more coins before time runs out.\nJump on your rival to steal their coins—it’s all part of the competition!",
